  "description": "Nam Hae-Sul, who is handsome but famous for his dog-like personality, is only nice to his childhood friend, Yang Mi-Ru. \"It's clear that he's nice to me because he likes me!\" But is it really like that? Mi-Ru has no idea about Hae-Sul’s true feelings. Then one day, she finds out about the \"black heart\" that he harbors! Cracks are starting to appear in their 10-year friendship...! The wild growth story of a wolf boy and an innocent girl!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
